cifs: check only tcon status on tcon related functions

jira KERNEL-814
Rebuild_History Non-Buildable kernel-4.18.0-553.115.1.el8_10
commit-author Shyam Prasad N <sprasad@microsoft.com>
commit 2f0e4f0342201fe2228fcc2301cc2b42ae04b8e3
Empty-Commit: Cherry-Pick Conflicts during history rebuild.
Will be included in final tarball splat. Ref for failed cherry-pick at:
ciq/ciq_backports/kernel-4.18.0-553.115.1.el8_10/2f0e4f03.failed

We had a couple of checks for session in cifs_tree_connect
and cifs_mark_open_files_invalid, which were unnecessary.
And that was done with ses_lock. Changed that to tc_lock too.

	Signed-off-by: Shyam Prasad N <sprasad@microsoft.com>
	Reviewed-by: Paulo Alcantara (SUSE) <pc@manguebit.com>
	Signed-off-by: Steve French <stfrench@microsoft.com>
(cherry picked from commit 2f0e4f0342201fe2228fcc2301cc2b42ae04b8e3)
	Signed-off-by: Jonathan Maple <jmaple@ciq.com>

